4. RAHASIA (nama & lokasi saja, nilai TIDAK pernah ditulis di dokumen/chat)
==================================================================================================
- GW/deploy/.env : API_MASTER_KEY, API_KEY_PEPPER
- WEB/deploy/.env: APP_KEY, DB_PASSWORD, WA_OTP_HMAC_SECRET, OPENWA_API_KEY (operator, scope otp-sender),
