  2026-10-12 di gateway lokal). Nilai lokal ≠ nilai VPS; VPS membuat sendiri.

==================================================================================================
5. ARSITEKTUR YANG HARUS DIPAHAMI SEBELUM MENGUBAH
==================================================================================================
- Customer OTP: React → /api/v1/auth/whatsapp/* → Laravel OtpService → OpenWaTransport → openwa:2785
  (key OPERATOR). JANGAN dirombak (test lulus).
- Admin gateway: React src/openwa (salinan dashboard OpenWA) → /gateway-api/*, /gateway-socket/*
  → nginx auth_request /_gateway_auth → Laravel GET /api/v1/admin/gateway-auth (204/401/403)
  → proxy openwa:2785 + X-API-Key dari env OPENWA_DASHBOARD_API_KEY (template nginx, envsubst ^OPENWA_).
- CSS: vite.config.ts plugin "openwa-css-isolation": CSS src/openwa diprefix .openwa-root; CSS toko
  (src/index.css) diberi :not(.openwa-root *). JANGAN pakai 100vw, JANGAN tambal dengan !important.
- Source asli wa-gateway/src dan wa-gateway/dashboard TIDAK diubah. Perubahan OpenWA hanya pada
  salinan di WEB/apps/react/src/openwa (daftar adaptasi di WORKTASK T19).

