8. PEMBARUAN SESI 2026-10-14 (MULTI-SENDER POOL, FAILOVER, BACK-OFFICE API & CLIENT)
==================================================================================================
- MULTI-SENDER POOL (T22, T23, D24, D25):
  * Tabel migration: api/database/migrations/2026_10_14_000001_create_sender_pool_table.php
  * Model: api/app/Models/SenderPool.php (enkripsi otomatis api_key via Crypt::encryptString, hidden di API)
  * Service: api/app/Services/WhatsAppOtp/SenderPoolService.php (CRUD sender, round-robin, failover, auto-cooldown reactivation)
  * Transport: api/app/Services/WhatsAppOtp/Transport/PooledTransport.php (rotasi round-robin last_used_at, auto-failover, fallback env jika tabel kosong)
  * Client: api/app/Services/WhatsAppOtp/OpenWaSessionClient.php diperluas untuk multi-session per sender
- ADMIN API & BACK-OFFICE CONTRACT (T24, T25, D27, D28):
  * Controller: SenderPoolController.php (/api/v1/admin/sender-pool/*)
  * Controller: VerifiedMembersController.php (/api/v1/admin/verified-members)
  * Webhook: member.verified dipicu otomatis saat member baru verifikasi OTP pertama kali (+ signature SHA256 HMAC)
- FRONTEND & MENU PEMISAHAN INFRA (T26, D26):
  * apps/react/src/components/SenderPoolPanel.tsx (daftar pool, tombol tambah nomor, QR code, 8-digit pairing code, test send)
  * apps/react/src/components/VerifiedMembersPanel.tsx (tabel member terverifikasi, pencarian nomor, pagination, statistik)
  * apps/react/src/openwa/pages.ts (halaman Infrastruktur disembunyikan kecuali VITE_SHOW_INFRA_PAGE=true)
  * apps/react/src/pages/AdminDashboard.tsx (navigasi Pool Nomor Pengirim dan Member Terverifikasi)
  * tsc -b dan vite build lulus 0 error.
- REFERENCE CLIENT LARAVEL (T27, D29):
  * reference-laravel-client/ berisi Service, Controller, Webhook listener, config, dan README siap pakai untuk tim UG Back-Office.
  * Disalin juga ke laravel-headless-starter/reference-laravel-client/ untuk kemudahan akses.
